      "id": "9cfe70f8-c27d-4366-a65c-65e1010d4303",
      "title": "Case ticket reads keep a separate 30-second gh limit",
      "description": "This PR adds one shared `gh` wrapper in `github.ts`, with a 60-second limit and a 64 MB buffer, and moves the listed scripts onto it. `packages/harness/src/case-ticket.ts:162` still defines its own inline `gh` around `execFileSync(\"gh\", ...)` with a 30-second timeout and the default buffer. Case-ticket calls therefore keep the inconsistent time-limit policy this change is meant to remove, and later changes to the shared limit or error shape will not reach them.",
