    {
      "id": "e0d34669-93f2-411b-b002-76428b112fae",
      "title": "Factory runs lose evidence with a custom private directory",
      "description": "`realDeps` computes `evidenceInPrivate` relative to the overridden `privateDir()` but resolves `evidenceDir(factory)` under the repository root, so the result can contain `..` segments that lead outside the private worktree. When `FAULTFORGE_PRIVATE_DIR` points elsewhere, `saveEvidence` writes run logs outside that worktree and `commitAndPublish` cannot stage them for delivery to the private repository.",
